            "notes": "## Items\n\nVery straightforward, we grab the most damage we can, which is attack speed items like [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) and [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a). [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) should be bought if you can\u2019t afford [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054), or if you have spare cash, since it only costs 7750.\n\n### Counterpick and optional items (I WON\u2019T BE GOING OVER THEM IN FUTURE ROUNDS, BUY THEM WHENEVER YOU HAVE ENOUGH MONEY OR FEEL LIKE THEY ARE GOOD)\n\n[Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) is a fantastic item and can almost never be bad since it makes you more tanky and easier to keep up for your supports. 5% attack speed and 5% movement speed is great. This should be the item you take most of the time if you have spare money.\n\n[Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) is another insane defensive option. This should be bought against Cass, Zen, Soldier, Reaper, Ashe (WP), Genji (he can crit with an item), and JQ (WP) \u2014 mostly heroes that generally like to headshot and play WP builds. It also gives 5% movement speed.\n\n[Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) should be taken over [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) whenever there\u2019s an enemy tank with armor (most of them) that you can bully. For example, you can sometimes bully a Winston, but you won\u2019t be able to bully a Rein, nor do you want to, because that\u2019s not something DVA excels at. Many heroes have shields by default like Zen and Juno or from items like [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da), and since the effect lasts so long, it basically allows you to kill them.\n\n[Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131) is another near must-pick item against Zarya.",
