            "notes": "## Items\n\nAt this point in the game, there\u2019s usually enough armor to justify [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27). It\u2019s also still a very cheap WP option.\n\n[Multi-Task Mod](item_40997c0f-a8e3-46ba-b312-34c0790d0e87) should be picked against non-armor-heavy comps.\n\n[El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) is great on DVA since you shoot so often and have an easy time landing headshots. This is particularly effective VS sticky comps that heal a lot.\n\nLastly, if you have a lot of cash, you can get [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) in combination with your damage item.",
