            "notes": "## Power\n\n[Ultrawide Matrix](item_403fe162-4a59-4a8e-8af9-5f83267228e8) is the obvious choice since we have [Face Tanking](item_f8af63d1-1fd4-4758-86ce-96f1ef7ea1ea). Otherwise, you will have a hard time staying alive.\n\nIf you didn\u2019t take [Focused Fusion](item_1123c91f-7348-4e50-aa1c-4a9961650f40) up until now, take it now.\n\n## Items\n\nI like running [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) because DVA gets ult so fast. The stats are insane when you have ult: 10% AS, 10% WP, 10% movement speed, and 100 HP. If you need to ult and the fight is still ongoing, it\u2019s fine since you get your ult fast, but you shouldn\u2019t ult without losing your mech or when fights are already over.\n\nThe other defensive item you can get is [Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4), since this works great with [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09).\n\nIf you feel like you aren\u2019t really under pressure yet, then you can just grab more damage with [Multi-Task Mod](item_40997c0f-a8e3-46ba-b312-34c0790d0e87) or [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100).\n\n## IMPORTANT UPGRADES\n\n[Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) can be replaced with [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) since, this late into the game, the 10% damage reduction is more important than 5% less AS when you have no armor. For sure, replace [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) with [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) if you have the cash for it.\n\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) should be replaced with [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) in the majority of games. If enemies aren\u2019t sticky with some sort of healing, you are going to win the game anyway, but what\u2019s stopping you from killing enemies are things like [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c), JQ passive healing, Moira AOE heals, Mercy pocketing someone, or Reaper lifesteal.",
