            "created_at": "2025-08-31T12:31:44.79462+00:00",
            "notes": "## Power\n\n[Stat Boost](item_d3ef725b-3183-417c-bc5a-76bfa21c6cc5) is an easy choice at this point because we already put two powers into matrix.\n\n## Items\n\nThis late into the game, your build falls off a bit since it can be hard to kill enemies. That\u2019s why I usually lean towards a more damage-oriented build by selling [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09). This build generates so much cash that you will often have enough, which is why I will list two full build versions below.\n\n## Damage Version\n\n- [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)  \n- [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce)  \n- [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f)  \n- [Multi-Task Mod](item_40997c0f-a8e3-46ba-b312-34c0790d0e87)  \n- [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if the targets you want to focus have armor (usually DPS and supports) OR [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) VS sticky comps with a lot of healing  \n- [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) OR [Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) OR another damage item with [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) if you are not dying  \n\n## Tanky Version\n\n- [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)  \n- [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce)  \n- [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f)  \n- [Multi-Task Mod](item_40997c0f-a8e3-46ba-b312-34c0790d0e87) OR [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if the targets you want to focus have armor (usually DPS and supports) OR [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) if your team has no debuff healing or when the enemy team has a lot of healing  \n- [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f)  \n- [Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4)",
